# Commit message scratch. Narrative commit bodies are written here and passed
# with `git commit -F`, so the command string stays short — a heredoc puts
# newlines in the command itself, which no permission pattern matches.
/.cmsg.txt

# Reference captures behind docs/*.md research. ~135 MB of PNG screenshots of
# other people's sites — evidence, not source. The JSON instrumentation dumps
# beside them are small and cited by build-plan.md, so those stay tracked.
/docs/hero-refs/
/docs/whole-page-narrative-refs/**/*.png
/docs/whole-page-narrative-refs/*.png
